TASK-188 runtime harness: the per-site picture in picture switch. Temporary
code, never committed to Detour/. Needs a local server with a playing video:

    SP=<scratch>/www; mkdir -p $SP
    ffmpeg -f lavfi -i testsrc=size=640x360:rate=30 -f lavfi -i sine=frequency=440 \
        -t 120 -c:v libx264 -pix_fmt yuv420p -c:a aac -shortest $SP/tone.mp4
    # video.html: <video src=tone.mp4 autoplay loop> plus a wrapper around
    # HTMLVideoElement.prototype.webkitSetPresentationMode that sets
    # document.title = 'PIP ' + mode; blank.html: any page.
    python3 -m http.server 8765 --bind 127.0.0.1 --directory $SP &
    git apply docs/harness/task188-harness.patch && xcodegen generate
    xcodebuild -scheme Detour -configuration Debug build -derivedDataPath .derived
    DETOUR_DATA_DIR=DetourVerify188 DETOUR_VERIFY_DIR="$OUT" DETOUR_VERIFY_PORT=8765 \
        .derived/Build/Products/Debug/Detour.app/Contents/MacOS/Detour &
    # "SHOOT <name> <windowNumber> <popoverWindowNumber>": screencapture -x -l <popover>
    # within 2 s; wait for "done" (about 37 s), kill that pid and the server.
    git apply -R docs/harness/task188-harness.patch && xcodegen generate

Opens the video at localhost (no setting) and at 127.0.0.1, leaves each while
it plays, and drives the site popover's switch with performClick, light then
dark. The macOS PiP window really opens on the default-site leg.

Results (2026-10-24): default site, leaving the playing tab entered PiP
(title "PIP picture-in-picture"); switch off for 127.0.0.1 stored one row
(127.0.0.1 pictureInPicture false, also covering a.127.0.0.1) and leaving
the playing tab did not enter PiP; switch back on removed the row and leaving
entered PiP again. Popover captured light and dark with the new row under
content blocking's switch.

